      "short": "a – C, b – A, c – D, d – B",
      "worked": "a → C: $$\\begin{align*}g^3(g^2+g^5)&=g^5+g^8\\end{align*}$$\n\nb → A: $$\\begin{align*}g^3(g^2\\times g^5)&=g^{3+2+5}=g^{10}\\end{align*}$$\n\nc → D: $$\\begin{align*}(g^2)^3+(g^5)^3&=g^6+g^{15}\\end{align*}$$\n\nd → B: $$\\begin{align*}(g^2)^3\\times(g^5)^3&=g^6\\times g^{15}=g^{21}\\end{align*}$$",
